<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light" />
  <meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light" />
  <title>Pagamento Recebido</title>
  <style>
    /* Paleta azul baseada em #0033AD
       --blue-900: #001F6B  (gradiente / texto escuro)
       --blue-700: #0033AD  (cor principal)
       Cinzas do card: fundo #F3F3F3 / borda #D4D4D4
       Verde para destaque do valor: #f0fff4 / #9ae6b4 / #276749
    */
    :root { color-scheme: light; supported-color-schemes: light; }
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body { background-color: #eef2fb; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; color: #1f2a44; }

    .wrapper { max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 16px; }
    .card { background: #F3F3F3; border: 1px solid #D4D4D4; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 51, 173, 0.12); }

    /* Header */
    .header { background-color: #0033AD; background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, #0033AD 0%, #001F6B 100%); padding: 40px 40px 32px; text-align: center; }
    .header .logo-text { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #fffffe; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .header h1 { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; color: #fffffe; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.3; }

    .body { padding: 36px 40px; }
    .greeting { font-size: 17px; color: #3c4a6b; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .greeting strong { color: #0033AD; }

    /* Destaque do valor pago */
    .amount-block { text-align: center; background: #f0fff4; border: 2px solid #9ae6b4; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .amount-label { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #276749; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .amount-value { font-size: 38px; font-weight: 800; color: #1c4532; }
    .amount-currency { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #276749; vertical-align: super; margin-right: 4px; }

    /* Detalhes */
    .info-grid { background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #D4D4D4; border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .info-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E2E2; }
    .info-row:first-child { padding-top: 0; }
    .info-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; padding-bottom: 0; }
    .info-label { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #0033AD; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
    .info-value { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #1f2a44; }

    .note { font-size: 14px; color: #5a6786; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px; }

    .footer { background: #EAEAEA; border-top: 1px solid #D4D4D4; padding: 24px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .footer p { font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.6; }
    .footer a { color: #0033AD; text-decoration: none; }

    /* Modo escuro */
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      .header { background-color: #0033AD !important; }
      .header .logo-text, .header h1, .header font { color: #fffffe !important; }
    }
    [data-ogsc] .header .logo-text, [data-ogsc] .header h1, [data-ogsc] .header font { color: #fffffe !important; }
    [data-ogsb] .header { background-color: #0033AD !important; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="card" style="background-color: #F3F3F3; border: 1px solid #D4D4D4;">

      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="header" bgcolor="#0033AD" style="background-color: #0033AD; background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, #0033AD 0%, #001F6B 100%); padding: 40px 40px 32px; text-align: center;">
        <div class="logo-text" style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #fffffe; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;">
          <font color="#fffffe">Lúmen Hotel</font>
        </div>
        <h1 style="font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; color: #fffffe; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.3;">
          <font color="#fffffe">Pagamento Recebido!</font>
        </h1>
      </div>

      <!-- Body -->
      <div class="body">

        <p class="greeting">
          Olá, <strong>{{guestName}}</strong>!<br/>
          Confirmamos o recebimento do seu pagamento. Abaixo está o comprovante
          da transação referente à sua reserva.
        </p>

        <!-- Destaque do valor -->
        <div class="amount-block">
          <div class="amount-label">Valor Pago</div>
          <div class="amount-value">
            <span class="amount-currency">{{currency}}</span>{{formattedAmount}}
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Detalhes da transação -->
        <div class="info-grid">
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Reserva</span>
            <span class="info-value">{{reservationCode}}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Forma de Pagamento</span>
            <span class="info-value">{{paymentMethod}}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Data da Transação</span>
            <span class="info-value">{{paidAt}}</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="note">
          Guarde este e-mail como comprovante do seu pagamento. Ele pode ser
          solicitado durante o check-in ou para fins de reembolso.
        </p>

        <p class="note">
          Em caso de dúvidas sobre a cobrança, entre em contato com nossa
          central de atendimento.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <div class="footer">
        <p>
          Este é um e-mail automático. Por favor, não responda.<br/>
          © {{currentYear}} Lúmen Hotel. Todos os direitos reservados.<br/>
          <a href="#">Política de Privacidade</a> · <a href="#">Termos de Uso</a><br/>
          Reserva {{reservationCode}} · Pago em {{paidAt}}
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
